00:05:37.749 --> 00:05:44.036
Ellen Ochoa, the first Hispanic woman in space, joined more than 100 astronauts in

00:05:44.036 --> 00:05:48.976
astronauts for America to urge young Americans to vote, military.com reports.

00:05:49.616 --> 00:05:54.836
The group affirms commitment to equality, liberty, freedom of speech, the rule of law, and

00:05:54.836 --> 00:05:55.976
the consent of the governed.

00:05:56.636 --> 00:06:01.316
Ochoa described her path to becoming an astronaut as tied to the expansion of voting rights

00:06:01.316 --> 00:06:03.816
that opened careers for women and people of color.

00:06:03.816 --> 00:06:12.836
She noted that when she changed her college major to physics, NASA had just selected its first group of astronauts that included women and astronauts of color.

00:06:13.456 --> 00:06:27.017
Ochoa flew with four other women in her 1990 astronaut class. The James Webb Space Telescope, or JWST, detected a strong emission line at 1.60 micrometers in the Hubble Ultra Deep Field.

00:06:27.377 --> 00:06:32.677
A report on the space subreddit says the observations used a new slitless spectroscopy technique.

00:06:32.677 --> 00:06:37.677
The line appeared in four dither positions and two position angles across observations

00:06:37.677 --> 00:06:39.637
separated by nearly three months.

00:06:40.217 --> 00:06:44.897
No source is visible in any prior Hubble or JWST imaging at that location.

00:06:45.417 --> 00:06:51.877
The observed frame equivalent width exceeds 7,620 angstroms, ruling out several common

00:06:51.877 --> 00:06:53.617
emission lines at lower red shifts.

00:06:54.197 --> 00:06:59.877
Possible explanations include an active galactic nucleus or a transient event, but none fully

00:06:59.877 --> 00:07:00.677
match the data.

00:07:00.677 --> 00:07:07.065
Winston Scott, who flew two NASA missions in the 1990s, argues that the vast number of

00:07:07.065 --> 00:07:10.445
planets makes it unlikely Earth is the only place life emerged.

00:07:10.965 --> 00:07:16.205
Voice of Emirates reports that he distinguishes between the statistical possibility of extraterrestrial

00:07:16.205 --> 00:07:19.525
life and any claims that such life has visited Earth.

00:07:20.005 --> 00:07:24.645
Scott also warned that growing competition among nations and private companies to develop

00:07:24.645 --> 00:07:28.985
satellite and lunar capabilities could lead to military conflict in space.

00:07:28.985 --> 00:07:33.965
He expressed hope that space remains dedicated to research and exploration rather

00:07:33.965 --> 00:07:39.445
than confrontation. Scott noted that cooperation on the International Space Station has not

00:07:39.445 --> 00:07:45.337
eliminated broader disagreements between major powers. In brief, four volunteers emerge

00:07:45.337 --> 00:07:51.757
from a Mars simulation facility after 378 days, and the run supplied crew health and performance

00:07:51.757 --> 00:07:57.677
data for future long-duration missions. Vietnam signed the Artemis Accords, the latest nation

